[statement]
A package whose condition can never hold, since nothing provides a name it
states, gives no place in the decision order to what it depends on. The
walk reaches `r` through `n` before `v` and `w`, and `r` needs `X`; yet
`Y`, which `top` states before `X`, is decided first, for `lo`, which
answers `X` too, and `hi` is not installed.

[repository]
P:top
V:1
D:n v w

P:n
V:1

P:r
V:1
i:n zz
D:X

P:hi
V:1
k:100
p:X

P:lo
V:1
p:X Y=1

P:w
V:1
D:X

P:v
V:1
D:Y

[request]
top

[answer apk-tools 3.0.9-r0]
install n 1
install lo 1
install v 1
install w 1
install top 1
